  <section class="eva-page-hero" id="overview" aria-labelledby="eva-page-title">
    <div class="eva-page-hero__glow" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></div>
    <div class="page-width eva-page-hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">EVA / A WE-Sensing venture</p>
      <h1 id="eva-page-title">A familiar pad. <span class="eva-gradient-text">A new layer of health insight.</span></h1>
      <p class="eva-page-hero__intro">EVA is a smart menstrual sensing pad under development, designed to measure selected biological changes in menstrual fluid through a product women already use.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-eva" href="#how-it-works">See How EVA Works</a>
        <a class="link-more link-more--eva" href="#partnerships">Explore Partnerships</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="eva-product-stage" data-expand>
      <div class="eva-product-stage__frame">
        <img src="/assets/eva/eva-hero-product.webp?v=20261001" width="1823" height="863" alt="Concept render of the EVA smart sensing pad, detachable reusable reader, and application">
        <div class="eva-product-stage__label"><span>Product system</span><span>Concept view</span></div>
        <figcaption class="eva-product-stage__legend"><span><i></i>Sensing pad</span><span><i></i>Reusable electronics</span><span><i></i>Longitudinal view</span></figcaption>
      </div>
    </figure>

    <div class="eva-hero-disclaimer">
      <span>Development status</span>
      <p>EVA is currently under development and is not available for clinical diagnosis or treatment decisions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="eva-need section" id="need" aria-labelledby="eva-need-title">
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="section-head split reveal">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">The need</p><h2 id="eva-need-title">Important biological changes remain invisible between clinical visits.</h2></div>
        <p class="section-lead">Wearable devices can reveal patterns in behavior and physiology, while clinical tests provide detailed information at individual moments. EVA is being developed to help capture selected biological changes during the time between those measurements.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="eva-timeline reveal" role="img" aria-label="Timeline showing EVA measurements between two clinical visits">
        <div class="eva-timeline__labels"><span>Clinical visit</span><span>Time between visits</span><span>Clinical visit</span></div>
        <div class="eva-timeline__chart">
          <svg class="eva-timeline__svg" viewBox="0 0 1000 220" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="evaCurve" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#e5677f"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#c94a6e"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9c3f78"/></linearGradient>
              <linearGradient id="evaArea" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#e97786" stop-opacity=".24"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e97786" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <path class="eva-timeline__base" d="M0 176H1000"/>
            <path d="M60 176C125 176 125 118 190 118C245 118 245 92 300 92C355 92 355 124 410 124C465 124 465 78 520 78C575 78 575 104 630 104C685 104 685 70 740 70C795 70 795 96 850 96C895 96 895 176 940 176Z" fill="url(#evaArea)"/>
            <path class="eva-timeline__curve" stroke="url(#evaCurve)" d="M60 176C125 176 125 118 190 118C245 118 245 92 300 92C355 92 355 124 410 124C465 124 465 78 520 78C575 78 575 104 630 104C685 104 685 70 740 70C795 70 795 96 850 96C895 96 895 176 940 176"/>
          </svg>
          <i class="visit-node" style="--x:6%" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <i class="visit-node" style="--x:94%" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span class="eva-timeline__points" aria-hidden="true">
            <i style="--x:19%;--y:53.6%;--i:0"></i><i style="--x:30%;--y:41.8%;--i:1"></i><i style="--x:41%;--y:56.4%;--i:2"></i><i style="--x:52%;--y:35.5%;--i:3"></i><i style="--x:63%;--y:47.3%;--i:4"></i><i style="--x:74%;--y:31.8%;--i:5"></i><i style="--x:85%;--y:43.6%;--i:6"></i>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="eva-timeline__caption"><span>Detailed measurement</span><strong>EVA longitudinal measurements</strong><span>Detailed measurement</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="eva-context-grid" data-stagger>
        <article class="eva-tile">
          <svg class="eva-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="14" y="13" width="20" height="22" rx="6"/><path d="M18.5 13l1.2-6h8.6l1.2 6M18.5 35l1.2 6h8.6l1.2-6M17.5 24.5h3.2l2-4.2 3 8.4 2-4.2h2.8"/></svg>
          <span>01</span><h3>Consumer wearables</h3><p>Can help reveal behavioral and physiological patterns through indirect signals.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="eva-tile">
          <svg class="eva-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 6h10M20.5 6v12.5L11.6 35.2A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 15.6 42h16.8a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4-6.8L27.5 18.5V6"/><path d="M14.5 31h19"/></svg>
          <span>02</span><h3>Clinical testing</h3><p>Provides detailed information at individual moments under clinical direction.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="eva-tile eva-tile--accent">
          <svg class="eva-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 9v30M40 9v30"/><path d="M8 32c5 0 6-9 10-9s5 5 8 5 4-12 8-12 4 4 6 4"/><circle cx="18" cy="23" r="2.2"/><circle cx="26" cy="28" r="2.2"/><circle cx="34" cy="16" r="2.2"/></svg>
          <span>03</span><h3>EVA’s intended role</h3><p>Explore longitudinal biological information between visits without replacing either approach.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="eva-product-design section" id="product-design" aria-labelledby="eva-product-title">
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="section-head split reveal">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Product design</p><h2 id="eva-product-title">Designed around a product women already know.</h2></div>
        <p class="section-lead">The EVA concept combines a disposable sensing pad, a detachable reader, and an application intended to organize measurements over time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="eva-component-intro" data-stagger>
        <article>
          <div class="eva-component-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M18 5h12a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7l4 3v6l-4 3v7a6 6 0 0 1-6 6H18a6 6 0 0 1-6-6v-7l-4-3v-6l4-3v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect x="20.5" y="13" width="7" height="22" rx="3.5"/></svg></div>
          <span>01</span><h3>Smart Sensing Pad</h3><p>A familiar disposable pad containing an integrated sensing region.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="eva-component-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><rect x="11" y="11" width="26" height="26" rx="8"/><circle cx="24" cy="26.5" r="1.9"/><path d="M20.5 37v-2.5h7V37"/></svg></div>
          <span>02</span><h3>Reusable Reader</h3><p>A detachable electronic device that captures and transfers sensor signals.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="eva-component-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><rect x="14" y="5" width="20" height="38" rx="5"/><path d="M21 9.5h6M18.5 31l4-5 3.5 3 4-7M18.5 36h11"/></svg></div>
          <span>03</span><h3>EVA Application</h3><p>A secure interface intended to organize measurements and present longitudinal trends.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="eva-gallery reveal" data-carousel>
      <div class="eva-gallery__viewport" data-carousel-viewport tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="EVA product views">
        <ul class="eva-gallery__track eva-product-gallery">
          <li class="eva-gallery-card eva-gallery-card--front" data-carousel-item>
            <div class="eva-gallery-card__meta"><span>01</span><h3>Pad front view</h3></div>
            <img class="eva-gallery-image eva-gallery-image--pad" src="/assets/eva/web/eva-pad.webp" width="1000" height="1280" alt="Front view of the EVA sensing pad" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </li>
          <li class="eva-gallery-card eva-gallery-card--back" data-carousel-item>
            <div class="eva-gallery-card__meta"><span>02</span><h3>Pad rear view</h3></div>
            <img class="eva-gallery-image eva-gallery-image--pad" src="/assets/eva/web/eva-pad-back.webp" width="1100" height="1150" alt="Rear view of the EVA sensing pad" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </li>
          <li class="eva-gallery-card eva-gallery-card--exploded eva-gallery-card--wide" data-carousel-item>
            <div class="eva-gallery-card__meta"><span>03</span><h3>Exploded layer view</h3></div>
            <img class="eva-gallery-image eva-gallery-image--layer" src="/assets/eva/web/sensing-layer.webp" width="1800" height="952" alt="EVA sensing-layer architecture" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </li>
          <li class="eva-gallery-card eva-gallery-card--reader eva-gallery-card--wide" data-carousel-item>
            <div class="eva-gallery-card__meta"><span>04</span><h3>Detachable reader</h3></div>
            <img class="eva-gallery-image" src="/assets/eva/web/logger-detach.webp" width="1200" height="1089" alt="Detachable EVA reader" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </li>
          <li class="eva-gallery-card eva-gallery-card--kit" data-carousel-item>
            <div class="eva-gallery-card__meta"><span>05</span><h3>Starter kit</h3></div>
            <img class="eva-gallery-image" src="/assets/eva/web/starterkit.webp" width="432" height="397" alt="EVA starter kit" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </li>
          <li class="eva-gallery-card eva-gallery-card--app" data-carousel-item>
            <div class="eva-gallery-card__meta"><span>06</span><h3>Application interface</h3></div>
            <img class="eva-gallery-image eva-gallery-image--application" src="/assets/eva/web/application.webp" width="913" height="1752" alt="EVA application interface" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="page-width eva-gallery__controls">
        <div class="carousel-dots" data-carousel-dots></div>
        <div class="carousel-buttons">
          <button class="carousel-btn" type="button" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous product view"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.5 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></button>
          <button class="carousel-btn" type="button" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next product view"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.5 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
